{"version":1,"content":"<p>摩託羅拉尚未正式發佈的新款防丟器 Moto Tag 3，近日已在亞馬遜英國站上架並接受預訂。該頁面自周五起便已上線，顯示產品採用「Pantone Lucent White」配色，售價為24.96英鎊，約合33美元，預計發貨時間為1至4個月。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587664.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:34:53.821741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:21:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_hash":"08ba6be6ab55a95904f9586727509cfaf4e7f70f74246b6d4b0df7d6ed017935","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}